{"title": "Command: Flee (Condition)", "pageid": 5385, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Command:_Flee_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has tick type", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Command Flee Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Command_Flee_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Command: Flee</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Has to move as far away from the spellcaster by the fastest available means.</li>\n<li>Cannot take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reactions</a>. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/imag